1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,786
今天早上Claude的语言列表里面突然
This morning, Claude's language list suddenly added Chinese —

2
00:00:02,806 --> 00:00:05,340
多了中文，简体繁体都有。
both Simplified and Traditional.

3
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:07,100
然后在Claude的官网和APP
On Claude's website and in the app,

4
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:10,080
里面去点击左下角选语言就可以看到。
tap the bottom-left corner and choose Language to see it.

5
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:12,014
但是Claude之前一直
But Claude has always had

6
00:00:12,034 --> 00:00:13,850
都是很明确的反华的态度，
a very clearly anti-China attitude,

7
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:16,406
无论是它大规模封号还是它的软件
whether it's the mass account bans, or the fact

8
00:00:16,426 --> 00:00:19,020
和网页从来都不支持中文。
that its app and website never supported Chinese.

9
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:20,738
然后我看了一下8月份的那一版
Then I looked at August's version

10
00:00:20,758 --> 00:00:21,610
Claude的更新，
of Claude's update.

11
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:22,859
它只写了更新11种
It only listed 11 languages,

12
00:00:22,879 --> 00:00:24,960
语言并没有包含中文。
and Chinese wasn't among them.

13
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:27,871
到目前为止它的官方博客官方
So far, its official blog and official

14
00:00:27,891 --> 00:00:31,090
推特到现在都没有提语言更新这件事。
Twitter haven't mentioned the language update at all.

15
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:33,780
我很担心这会不会是钓鱼执法，
I'm worried — could this be entrapment?

16
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:36,291
让中文用户先选择中文之后，
Let Chinese users pick Chinese first, then IP-location

17
00:00:36,311 --> 00:00:39,520
IP位置检测加语言直接封号清算。
checks plus language lead straight to bans and purges.

18
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:40,990
不过现在语言能选，
Still, even though the language

19
00:00:41,010 --> 00:00:43,640
在国内也是没有办法使用的。
can now be picked, it can't be used in China.

20
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:45,494
官方支持地区名单里面
The official supported-regions list

21
00:00:45,514 --> 00:00:48,260
没有包含中国大陆、香港和澳门。
doesn't include mainland China, Hong Kong or Macao.

22
00:00:48,510 --> 00:00:52,100
如果使用的方法不当的话就会封号。
If it's used the wrong way, you'll get banned.

23
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:55,081
我真的想拜托Claude什么
I really want to ask Claude

24
00:00:55,101 --> 00:00:56,590
时候能学一学ChatGPT，
to learn from ChatGPT someday —

25
00:00:56,610 --> 00:00:59,411
虽然GPT在国内也不支持使用和注册，
Although GPT isn't supported or open for sign-up in China

26
00:00:59,431 --> 00:01:02,340
但是它并没有那么严重的封号。
either, it doesn't ban nearly as severely.
